<title>USA: A.M. Best says Zenith Natl under review.</title>
<headline>A.M. Best says Zenith Natl under review.</headline>
<dateline>OLDWICK, N.J. 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>A.M. Best Co said Friday it placed the A+ (Superior) rating of Zenith National Insurance Group under review with negative implications.</p>
<p>The rating actions follows Zenith's announcement that it has entered into a definitive agreement to buy all assets relating to RISCORP's workers' compensation business, including its existing in-force insurance business and the right to all new and renewal policies.</p>
<p>Zenith will also assume certain liabilities of RISCORP.</p>
